{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Preparing the Proposal", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Technician's Assessment", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Present advice on solving technical problems in a work context and appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using Expressions like <span class=\"italic\">of course</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">of course</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>To say \u201cyes\u201d as an answer to a question.<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>\u201cDo you want help with the printer?\u201d<br/> \u201c<span class=\"strong\">Of course</span>.\u201d</li></ul></span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>To say that you agree or disagree with someone.</li><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>\u201cI guess I need a new printer.\u201d <br/>\u201c<span class=\"strong\">Of course</span> you do.\u201d</li></ul></span></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>To say something that you believe someone probably already knows or will not be surprised about.<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>\u201c<span class=\"strong\">Of course</span>. The printer has run out of paper.\u201d </li></ul></span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>To add something to what you have just said, especially something that may seem surprising.<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>The printer is new. <span class=\"strong\">In fact</span>, we purchased it less than two months ago.</li></ul></span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for, Giving and Responding to Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In the workplace, you will often be requested to give, ask for, and respond to advice. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\">modal verb</span> <span class=\"italic\">should</span> is the most common way of giving advice. However, there are other ways to do that. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I hate to tell you but</span> ... + phrase<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I hate to tell you this</span> but it is not going to be cheap.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">Do you want me to</span> + verb?<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Do you want me to check</span> if the light is on?</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Other ways to ask for, give and respond to advice: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you suggest</span> + verb <br/> <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you recommend</span> + verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would go with</span> ... + noun <br/> <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I recommend</span> + noun / <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Thanks for the advice. <br/> <br/>I'll keep it in mind.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "When it comes to giving advice, we normally use the word <span class=\"italic\">recommend</span>. It is, therefore, important to understand common patterns with the word <span class=\"italic\">recommend</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"1\"><span class=\"italic\">recommend</span> + (<span class=\"italic\">that</span>) + clause <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">recommend that</span> you buy a more modern printer. </span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"2\"><span class=\"italic\">strongly</span> + <span class=\"italic\">recommend</span> + pronoun + verb <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">strongly recommend you buy</span> a more modern printer. </span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"3\"><span class=\"italic\">recommend</span> + <span class=\"italic\">-ing </span> <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">recommend</span> buy<span class=\"strong\">ing</span> a more modern printer. </span></li></ol>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "side panel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a removable piece from a printer that allows you to see inside a printer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Let's open this side panel and look inside the printer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when solving a technical issue.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "outdated ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "no longer useful because of being old-fashioned", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The machine has become outdated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "toner ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a type of ink used in printers", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The toner has run completely dry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to expire", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to not be of use anymore", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will have the same issue again once the toner expires.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "laser printer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a printer that produces good quality printouts by means of a laser ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm thinking of getting a laser printer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "inkjet ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a printer that uses very small jets to blow ink onto paper in order to form letters, numbers, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have an inkjet printer at home.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a gadget from your office that you think does not work properly. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask a partner for advice on what to do with it. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Respond to your partner's advice (use \u201cin fact\u201d when possible).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, switch roles. You partner will ask you for advice and you will give him or her advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Decide whether you are going to keep the gadget or follow your partner's advice.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify a gadget that isn't working properly. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions on how to fix it. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give and follow advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use \u201cin fact\u201d when responding to advice.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le04ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Hi Joe. I'm very glad to see you! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: So, your printer has been giving you problems? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Actually, as of this morning, our printer hasn't given us anything! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: Have you heard any unusual noises? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: No, it has the same gentle hum as always. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: Let's open this side panel and look inside. Ah, of course! The toner has run completely dry. Did you notice anything unusual before today?"}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "25000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes, all my sheets were printing out with streaks yesterday. In fact, I think I had several sheets print out where the ink looked a little blotchy. Do you want me to show you one? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: I hate to tell you but the answer will be costly. The machine has become outdated. You'll need to replace it. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: That's surprising. It's not that old. In fact, we purchased it less than three years ago. Aside from the toner it has run perfectly until now. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: Unfortunately the industry has been producing new toners that do not match the old machines."}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob02re2img07.jpg", "time": "59000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Would you advise me to find an old model with a good toner?  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: Of course, but you will have the same issue again once the toner expires. I recommend a new machine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Thanks for the advice. Would you suggest inkjet or laser?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Technician</span>: I would go with laser. It's more expensive however they are faster and usually less problematic than the inkjet.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Of course, we'll put it in the budget immediately."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le04ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can problem-solve a technical issue.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">of course</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in fact</span>.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for, give and respond to advice.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " When was the last time you experienced a technical issue?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What did you do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time to fix the printer! ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Janet gets some bad news. What's going to happen with the printer? ", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect